---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "SELECT t.a FROM t FULL JOIN u ON t.a = u.a WHERE u.d = 'y' AND t.b = 'x'"
---
Project [a#0]
+- Join Inner, (a#0 == a#3)
   :- Project [a#0]
   :  +- Filter ((b#1 == 'x') and isnotnull(a#0))
   :     +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1]
   +- Project [a#3]
      +- Filter ((d#4 == 'y') and isnotnull(a#3))
         +- Scan spark_catalog.default.u [a#3, d#4]
